{
  "id": "audio_music",
  "comfy": "image",
  "note": "Text to music (game background music) on the medium audio checkpoint, cut into a seamless loop by the NovaFlow audio node. Verified against ComfyUI 0.37.0 on 127.0.0.1:8188. Prompt rewriting is performed by the shared Flash session before this generation graph is queued.",
